WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
- So right now, I'm driving downtown

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.400
to go do a rehearsal for Vlog University.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.233
It's happening tomorrow.

00:00:04.233 --> 00:00:05.280
Depending on when you're watching it,

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.790
it might be happening right now,

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:10.625
and of course, it's Los
Angeles, so there's traffic.

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:13.542
(calm piano music)

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:26.970
Made it downtown to the convention center.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:30.110
We're about to head in and go
start setting up for tomorrow.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.610
(calm music)

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.560
Guys, look, this is the banner.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.940
Vlog University is here.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.260
This is so exciting.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.600
So everything is still
being set up for tomorrow.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.433
This is our little

00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:46.266
check in desk.
- Whoa, whoa, no filming.

00:00:46.266 --> 00:00:47.310
No filming.
(Justine laughs)

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.310
- They told me not film
because it looks messy

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.380
and this isn't what it's gonna look like,

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.110
but I was like, this is us vlogging.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:53.360
This is what we do.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.273
We film behind the scenes,
but I wanna show you guys,

00:00:55.273 --> 00:00:56.910
this what I'm really excited about.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.590
Okay, come, come, come.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.640
We have so much fun Vlog U swag.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:01.610
We have pink water bottles.

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:02.560
They had a bunch of different colors,

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.850
but as soon as I saw this hot pink,

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:06.100
I knew immediately we needed this one.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:07.603
We also got a little backpack.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:10.287
Do I look like I'm going to school?

00:01:10.287 --> 00:01:13.000
(calm music)

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:13.833
Vlog U pens.

00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:14.991
We also have some tote bags.

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:15.824
I don't know where I'm going,

00:01:15.824 --> 00:01:16.798
I'm just walking.

00:01:16.798 --> 00:01:19.298
(calm music)

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.400
Here's some of our sponsors,
so thank you, guys.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.450
Over here is one of the breakout rooms.

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.380
We're gonna be having panels and sessions,

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:30.420
and everything is not set up yet.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:31.253
Oh, wow, look at this.

00:01:31.253 --> 00:01:32.490
Whoa, there's lots of seats.

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:33.670
I'm excited to see this tomorrow.

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:34.890
It's gonna be a surprise to me

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:38.930
because I don't even know 100%
what it's gonna look like.

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:41.820
We've seen pictures,
we've talked about things,

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:44.130
but you never actually
know until the day of,

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.370
so you guys are gonna get to see it.

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:46.540
What's over here?

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.570
Oh, here's another little room.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:50.340
I just keep thinking about

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:52.330
how crazy it is that this whole thing

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.410
started from a little YouTube show

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:55.560
that I started 10 years ago.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:58.100
There's still tickets if
you wanna get them online,

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.300
so make sure you check
out vloguniversity.com

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.590
and we're gonna be here all weekend,

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:02.669
so hope to see you guys.

00:02:02.669 --> 00:02:05.169
(calm music)

00:02:18.309 --> 00:02:19.900
Here's the red carpet.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:21.100
We're gonna roll it out.

00:02:22.239 --> 00:02:24.069
(low shuffling)

00:02:24.069 --> 00:02:25.990
(calm music)

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:29.878
Do it for the 'gram or
the TikTok or the Byte.

00:02:29.878 --> 00:02:32.628
(Justine laughs)

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:35.823
Oh, this is not that fun.

00:02:37.589 --> 00:02:40.339
(Justine grunts)

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:44.963
Got the shot.

00:02:48.002 --> 00:02:48.891
♪ Roll out ♪

00:02:48.891 --> 00:02:49.789
♪ Me and my homies ♪

00:02:49.789 --> 00:02:51.311
♪ Roll out ♪

00:02:51.311 --> 00:02:52.480
(mellow music)

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.460
- So here's the theater

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:54.870
where the keynote's gonna be happening.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:55.703
I'm so excited.

00:02:55.703 --> 00:02:56.570
My friend Josh Sundquist,

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.150
who I'm sure most of you guys know

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.960
here on YouTube, he's incredible.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.850
He's gonna be also doing the keynote

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:03.470
and I can't believe it.

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:05.080
It's crazy because I met him,

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.033
oh my gosh, at the first Vidcon.

00:03:07.033 --> 00:03:08.970
So that fact that he's
now here doing the keynote

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:11.693
at Vlog University's so great.

00:03:12.653 --> 00:03:14.783
All right, it's go time.

00:03:14.783 --> 00:03:17.450
(mellow music)

